    <string name="privacy_body">I-Muslim ihlonipha ubumfihlo bakho begodu ayibutheleli idatha yakho. bala isikhathi somthandazo kanye ne-qibla kudivayisi yakho, begodu azithunyelwa kiyo nanyana ngiyiphi iseva yangaphandle.\n• Iimvumo kwaphela lokha nazitlhogekako: sibawa iimvumo (indawo, izaziso) kwaphela lokha isici nasizitlhogako, ngokuhlathulula okucacileko.\n• Akukho ukuxhumana okukatelelweko: i-app isebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi; ukusetjenziswa kwenethiwekhi akukhethwa ngokupheleleko malungana nokungezelelwa okufana nokudawuniloda ukuphindaphinda.</string>
